      "message": "Merge upstream main into issue/1449-predrilled-entry\n\nKeeps both sides: main's start-point refusal (#1448) after the\npredrilled one in sane.rs; main's rest2d and pocket_strategy modules\nbeside predrilled. `pocket_over` (split out by #1446 for rest\nmachining) now takes the proved holes; rest machining passes none.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
