      "message": "test(motion): pin the pre-drilled hole's area check and link proof each alone\n\nReview of #1493: deleting either check by itself stayed green, because\nthe pocket's re-seating made both hold at the public entry. Two unit\npins on hand-built levels now isolate them:\n- a hole on a pass start outside the cutter-centre area is refused\n  (only the area check stands; the link is skipped at the start);\n- a hole inside the area whose link crosses a planned pass is refused\n  (only the link proof stands).\nEach has a served control. Mutating either check turns only its own pin red.\n\nRefs #1449\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
